    {
      "id": "C-0047",
      "text": "For local stdio (fallback), surface CONTEXT7_API_KEY as the same-named environment variable in .mcp.json's env block — never as a --api-key CLI flag, because the CLI form bakes the secret into a process-listing-visible argv.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-005-context7.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
